# Gin Martini — stirred, up.
#
# The base gin is the $brand parameter: `make martini with Crowsfoot`
# pours that gin; bare `make martini` uses the house pour. This is the
# same `def <name> ($brand) { … }` shape the demonstration-capture
# Transcriber emits from a hand build — authored here by hand to show the
# *authored-as-content* source (the second of the three authoring paths).
def martini ($brand) {
  pour $brand into mixing glass
  pour vermouth into mixing glass
  stir mixing glass
  strain mixing glass into glass
}
